    "detailed_description": "<strong>You have become a &quot;Mochi&quot;.</strong><br><strong>A perfectly round &quot;Mochi&quot;.</strong><br>Navigate through 2D scrolling dungeons, avoiding brutal traps, and single-mindedly aim for the goal .<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><strong>\u25a0 Simple controls with only lateral movement and jumping</strong><br>However, precise control is required, so the <u>difficulty level is high</u>.<br>Increasing the game speed in the game settings will make it an <u>even more challenging game</u>.<br><br><strong>\u25a0 Normal play consists of 4 stages in total</strong><br>If you fail, you will restart from the beginning of the stage.<br>It is possible to pause the game and resume it later, but you cannot save and retry from the same point multiple times.<br>Once you clear a stage, you can play it individually.<br><br><strong>\u25a0 Replayability</strong><br>As mentioned above, you can change the game speed.<br>It can be changed in 4 stages, and playing at the highest speed boasts incredible difficulty.<br>There is also a mode to conquer all speeds sequentially.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming</h2>\u30fbStreaming is allowed without permission for both individuals and corporations.<br>\u30fbMonetization is only allowed when using features provided by video streaming platforms.<br>\u30fbWe would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title or description of the video, and if you include a link to the Steam page in the description.<br><br>We do not take any responsibility for damages caused by streaming videos of this game.<br>Furthermore, the contents of this guideline are subject to change without notice.",
